BY022 [*] `@dataclass(slots=True)` can be written as `data`
 --> BY022.by:6:1
  |
6 | @dataclass(slots=True)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
7 | class Point:
8 |     x: int = 0
  |
help: Replace with the `data` modifier
  |
5 |
  - @dataclass(slots=True)
  - class Point:
6 + data class Point:
7 |     x: int = 0
  |

