BY022 [*] `@staticmethod` can be written as `static`
  --> BY022.by:43:5
   |
41 |     # only the last decorator is rewritten; the next run takes the one above it
42 |     @final
43 |     @staticmethod
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
44 |     def both() -> int:
45 |         return 0
   |
help: Replace with the `static` modifier
   |
42 |     @final
   -     @staticmethod
   -     def both() -> int:
43 +     static def both() -> int:
44 |         return 0
   |

